{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0470886912073b1ea830fb09cd8cfedfda1ccf6f349ad9204baa7357ea6a5c2c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"The DatabaseAgent stores programs with code, fitness scores, generation, and lineage as a record of evolutionary history; the README notes this storage is currently in-memory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2d17cbaacef4034af336c7036a360980cdfa1ba58a500159940345894d9b8286","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_179cc02ff5b742ff3afca2e3b0a2082967e4d115b9c0900825847fb4561acc9b"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"The README's disclaimer states this is an experimental project whose generated code may not always be optimal, correct, or secure, and should be reviewed and tested thoroughly before production use.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_48c202c3ce22f3b37976a2cd5e94b20d6485fcba6b40620d8ae663c32e614a9a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e3965f52b9375311b1fc82ce8eb44501334dffda290a2ed17ebffc9a37409835"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"Per the README feature list, generated code is executed in Docker containers for sandboxed evaluation, with configurable timeout mechanisms.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4dcb233eec2d76efe1d0c6d69be71ef878aa36f552b92a7b53e3b7a4b4076e5c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9","slc_51c51ef6b9263417c36d4a8fbb7d851c9755378c47b9d369ce8f895660ef8f8d"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"The system uses a modular agent architecture with named agents: PromptDesignerAgent, CodeGeneratorAgent, EvaluatorAgent, DatabaseAgent, SelectionControllerAgent, and a task_manager agent that orchestrates the evolutionary loop and coordinates the others.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_656ee61ec88e72d115cd2a81cab3dedc00b97cbb46480cc385bd7143abc55fff","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a741784eac64db5814d93fadfb26df99af2536c740206b740a9e6b9d8269f5be"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"The CLI entry point runs an evolutionary run via 'python -m main <task.yaml>' (e.g., examples/shortest_path.yaml), with logs also saved to alpha_evolve.log by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6bf311b4dca724d03b43287b96a02a33c550507a14b64c2b6ee2cdb0e439e31c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9","slc_e3965f52b9375311b1fc82ce8eb44501334dffda290a2ed17ebffc9a37409835"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"Mutation and bug-fix prompts often request changes in diff format, and the code generator attempts to apply received diffs to the parent code; the features list describes diff-based mutations for targeted modifications.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_710932ecc951899eeb3f531edcef1c32a113e5a202758f0c3d54086eb987e9bf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1301223ba40c2150ea7e615943a1d407734cea6fc6f8ae7e0d4c81a0fd58c6ff","slc_b61099c40a8092b91a37fb494dc7141aaf3e9cb21bcf810bc20daf794cf71556"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors are asked to report bugs or suggest features via GitHub issues, and to fork the repo, create a feature branch, write clean documented code, add tests if applicable, avoid breaking existing functionality, and submit pull requests with clear descriptions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b79a1dc768c450e1c2cad875a871deee50bb57fb581b1e65bff04c336a67a628","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"shyamsaktawat/openalpha_evolve@0389aea0e0a7 snapshot d4155f4b317d4239","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4fe209d4ca4a043d68e1e601c79a2d6654bc8c54239aa47373393746c3a4c8d9"],"source_ids":["src_db862ace9ca35dd5b26d6662abfe9500"],"text":"The EvaluatorAgent syntax-checks generated code, executes it in an isolated environment against task input/output examples, and scores fitness based on correctness (test cases passed), runtime efficiency, and other potential metrics.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_300325db995647a2b983cdb81a020b6b"}
